---

This project (agent-cli-gateway) is a fork of cc-connect
(https://github.com/chenhg5/cc-connect). The IM platform layer was stripped
and replaced with a clean HTTP/SSE gateway API, and multi-user session
governance was added. The original MIT License applies to all original code.
